    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be a magical detective in New York City?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s your chance in <i>City of Spells</i>, where you use magic to solve mysteries and fight crime. Featuring an AI-powered dialogue system that lets you interact with characters any way you want! This  allows the player to help, hurt, lie, or flirt their way through quests and story arcs in unique and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story centers around a young girl named Allison, who finds her beloved city overrun by crime and demons. Will you align yourself with Heaven or Hell in this modern fantasy adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Powered\u00a0 Dialogue\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Converse with chatbots derived from LLAMA 3.2 8b Large Language Model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Magic System</strong> \u2013 Solve crimes <i>and</i> fight demons with hand drawn spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Branching Story</strong> \u2013 Differing story paths based on player morality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True-Crime Inspired Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Unravel chilling cases with a supernatural twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A stylish blend of classic JRPG visuals and noir intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 A serious story that knows when to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime, Cults, &amp; Chaos</strong> \u2013 Face off against anarcho-Maoists and Yakuza-inspired crime lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An indie game for fans of visual novels, magical fantasy, and anime-inspired storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Ace Attorney meets Persona, meets Harry Potter.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be a magical detective in New York City?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/f8178646b8ea5540850000be0b8fe4ac.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s your chance in <i>City of Spells</i>, where you use magic to solve mysteries and fight crime. Featuring an AI-powered dialogue system that lets you interact with characters any way you want! This  allows the player to help, hurt, lie, or flirt their way through quests and story arcs in unique and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/62fdd3cae2290316b3ec488b9fd658aa.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story centers around a young girl named Allison, who finds her beloved city overrun by crime and demons. Will you align yourself with Heaven or Hell in this modern fantasy adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.poster.avif?t=1753974115\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.webm?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/extras/4c177e10fac765d99e947c4296a3eac4.mp4?t=1753974115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Powered\u00a0 Dialogue\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Converse with chatbots derived from LLAMA 3.2 8b Large Language Model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Magic System</strong> \u2013 Solve crimes <i>and</i> fight demons with hand drawn spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Branching Story</strong> \u2013 Differing story paths based on player morality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True-Crime Inspired Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Unravel chilling cases with a supernatural twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A stylish blend of classic JRPG visuals and noir intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 A serious story that knows when to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime, Cults, &amp; Chaos</strong> \u2013 Face off against anarcho-Maoists and Yakuza-inspired crime lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An indie game for fans of visual novels, magical fantasy, and anime-inspired storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Ace Attorney meets Persona, meets Harry Potter.</p>",
